repository-code: https://github.com/gufranco/sony-s-smp-python
url: https://github.com/gufranco/sony-s-smp-python
abstract: >-
  A model of the Sony S-SMP, the audio unit a Super Nintendo talks to rather than
  into. The processor and the sound generator are separate members of the same
  family, consumed here as submodules; what this adds is the memory they share,
  the four ports the console reaches, three timers, and the boot program that
  hands a console's upload into memory. The upload protocol is read off that boot
  program rather than copied from an implementation.
keywords:
